  <component name="VcsManagerConfiguration">
    <MESSAGE value="inventory items background image issue fixed" />
    <MESSAGE value="Add CI standalone release tarball deploy for PreProd and Prod.&#10;&#10;Build in GitHub Actions, SCP artifact, apply-release on VPS with parameterized flags; probe SSH :22 with clear firewall guidance." />
    <MESSAGE value="Allow CI next build without MySQL for PreProd release artifacts.&#10;&#10;Site layout is dynamic; CMS/nav/catalog reads return safe fallbacks on connection refused so GitHub Actions can package standalone releases." />
    <MESSAGE value="Fix CI SCP tarball path so apply-release finds /tmp/zigma-*.tgz.&#10;&#10;appleboy/scp-action was nesting dist/; flatten before upload and resolve common remote paths." />
    <MESSAGE value="Fix VPS apply step: drop ssh-action script_stop that hid errors.&#10;&#10;script_stop breaks conditionals and swallows stderr after the tarball ls." />
    <MESSAGE value="Fix missing apply-release.sh in CI release ship step.&#10;&#10;Package scripts reliably and SCP apply-release.sh alongside the tarball so VPS apply does not depend on extracting it from the archive." />
    <MESSAGE value="Fix release verify false failure from tar|grep pipefail SIGPIPE.&#10;&#10;Also drop apps/src/storage from the staged standalone tree." />
    <MESSAGE value="Harden VPS apply rsync for deploy-user permissions and leftover dirs.&#10;&#10;Skip chown/chgrp, protect apps/storage/src from --delete, bind Next to 127.0.0.1." />
    <MESSAGE value="Tolerate rsync dir utime failures on unowned VPS app root.&#10;&#10;omit-dir-times and accept code 23 when release files verified." />
    <MESSAGE value="Standalone deploy only ships traced server deps. scripts/db-import.mjs can’t resolve mysql2 from that tree" />
    <MESSAGE value="Install mysql2 into release stage via npm instead of a hand-copied dep list.&#10;Hand-copied packages missed sql-escaper and broke CI packaging." />
    <MESSAGE value="Fix PreProd gallery background: ensure DB column and ship current catalog mapping.&#10;Self-heal background_image_url, pin PM2 cwd for assets, unify publicMediaUrl for admin/public." />
    <MESSAGE value="Include SQL migrations in release tarball so VPS apply can ensure schema.&#10;&#10;Previously only *.sh/*.mjs were packed, so migrate-*.sql never reached PreProd." />
    <MESSAGE value="background_image_url issue" />
    <MESSAGE value="prod background_image_url issue" />
    <MESSAGE value="poweredByPrefix added to admin to edit" />
    <MESSAGE value="#1 The mega menu was offset with translateY(0.8rem) on hover, so the pointer left the menu item in that gap and the submenu closed" />
    <MESSAGE value="#3 Two catalog UI fixes:&#10;   1. Popup catalog-gallery-media — Removed the inset frame box-shadow. Also hardened gallery background so background-image isn’t wiped by the background shorthand (inline size/position included).&#10;   2. catalog-card image — Cards used next/image with fill on a position: absolute media layer; this Next version only paints fill when the parent is relative or display: block. Switched to a plain &lt;img&gt; with cover sizing (same pattern as hub cards), so thumbnails show correctly again." />
    <MESSAGE value="#4 Product, Services, Project Pages Hero and Catalog filter controls from admin" />
    <MESSAGE value="#4 show/hide switch in admin for catalog-hero-standard-panel" />
